text 16,379 784x18 f0 left c4 m1 ink 16,379 445x18 | Every book needs a plant of its own, in the cubby above, below or beside it.
text 16,406 784x18 f0 left c4 m1 ink 16,406 308x18 | Plants never touch each other, not even at a corner.
text 16,433 784x18 f0 left c4 m1 ink 16,433 630x18 | The numbers say how many plants each row and column holds. A number turns solid when its line is right.
text 16,460 784x18 f0 left c4 m1 ink 16,460 386x18 | Tap a cubby for a plant, again to cross it out, and again to clear it.
